{"3590740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Defiant Ascent", "steam_appid": 3590740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW LONG CAN YOU SURVIVE UNDERGROUND?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this post-apocalyptic survival game, you wake up deep inside a bunker devastated by catastrophe. The rooms are shrouded in darkness, resources are scarce, and the horrors lurking behind every door won't give you a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the bunker room by room in a procedurally generated world where every run is different. Scavenge supplies, find or craft improvised weapons, and face off against enemies in a turn-based combat system where every decision could mean the difference between life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/248ecc14c4c23a05a7d5ee1ba29e5566.webp?t=1788192508\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/296c0ecfb44512413729bfdcbdcd55a7.poster.avif?t=1788192508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/296c0ecfb44512413729bfdcbdcd55a7.webm?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/296c0ecfb44512413729bfdcbdcd55a7.mp4?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step brings you closer to exhaustion. Will curiosity lead you deeper, or will caution keep you alive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/b02212ba0a099e1ea159ae2d6a69381c.webp?t=1788192508\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/2ace9d4b6399a0b1341efcc45a556c7a.poster.avif?t=1788192508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/2ace9d4b6399a0b1341efcc45a556c7a.webm?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/2ace9d4b6399a0b1341efcc45a556c7a.mp4?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face deadly enemies in tense duels where planning and speed matter. Weapons don't last forever, so choose your battles wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/8111ea127340b44a96dbc00a3bcf4224.webp?t=1788192508\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/5162cfd5b24673abfaebfe33d940c4c6.poster.avif?t=1788192508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/5162cfd5b24673abfaebfe33d940c4c6.webm?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/5162cfd5b24673abfaebfe33d940c4c6.mp4?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what you find to cook food, make medicine, create improvised weapons, and upgrade your base. Every resource counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/5498c4008a5dc7cc53504067a0b079d2.webp?t=1788192508\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/f53df993a35f9daeb4eb66b47da475b2.poster.avif?t=1788192508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/f53df993a35f9daeb4eb66b47da475b2.webm?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/f53df993a35f9daeb4eb66b47da475b2.mp4?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, completing achievements unlocks permanent perks. At the start of each run, choose which perks to activate, creating different strategies based on your style and progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/d937056a28dd803433cacc68fabb06fe.webp?t=1788192508\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/d1d273f94fe5272a74a6703ddcd3db5f.poster.avif?t=1788192508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/d1d273f94fe5272a74a6703ddcd3db5f.webm?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/d1d273f94fe5272a74a6703ddcd3db5f.mp4?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is different, and every death is final. But every attempt teaches you something new. Learn, adapt, and survive... <strong>if you can</strong>.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOW LONG CAN YOU SURVIVE UNDERGROUND?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this post-apocalyptic survival game, you wake up deep inside a bunker devastated by catastrophe. The rooms are shrouded in darkness, resources are scarce, and the horrors lurking behind every door won't give you a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the bunker room by room in a procedurally generated world where every run is different. Scavenge supplies, find or craft improvised weapons, and face off against enemies in a turn-based combat system where every decision could mean the difference between life and death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/248ecc14c4c23a05a7d5ee1ba29e5566.webp?t=1788192508\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/296c0ecfb44512413729bfdcbdcd55a7.poster.avif?t=1788192508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/296c0ecfb44512413729bfdcbdcd55a7.webm?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/296c0ecfb44512413729bfdcbdcd55a7.mp4?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step brings you closer to exhaustion. Will curiosity lead you deeper, or will caution keep you alive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/b02212ba0a099e1ea159ae2d6a69381c.webp?t=1788192508\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/2ace9d4b6399a0b1341efcc45a556c7a.poster.avif?t=1788192508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/2ace9d4b6399a0b1341efcc45a556c7a.webm?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/2ace9d4b6399a0b1341efcc45a556c7a.mp4?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face deadly enemies in tense duels where planning and speed matter. Weapons don't last forever, so choose your battles wisely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/8111ea127340b44a96dbc00a3bcf4224.webp?t=1788192508\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/5162cfd5b24673abfaebfe33d940c4c6.poster.avif?t=1788192508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/5162cfd5b24673abfaebfe33d940c4c6.webm?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/5162cfd5b24673abfaebfe33d940c4c6.mp4?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use what you find to cook food, make medicine, create improvised weapons, and upgrade your base. Every resource counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/5498c4008a5dc7cc53504067a0b079d2.webp?t=1788192508\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/f53df993a35f9daeb4eb66b47da475b2.poster.avif?t=1788192508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/f53df993a35f9daeb4eb66b47da475b2.webm?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/f53df993a35f9daeb4eb66b47da475b2.mp4?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, completing achievements unlocks permanent perks. At the start of each run, choose which perks to activate, creating different strategies based on your style and progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/d937056a28dd803433cacc68fabb06fe.webp?t=1788192508\" width=780 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/d1d273f94fe5272a74a6703ddcd3db5f.poster.avif?t=1788192508\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/d1d273f94fe5272a74a6703ddcd3db5f.webm?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590740/extras/d1d273f94fe5272a74a6703ddcd3db5f.mp4?t=1788192508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_p